---
title: "authCallback - Discord OAuth Callback (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse: parse code, error, auth_next from request URL and cookies
    q_parse --> q_oauth_error: error param present
    q_oauth_error --> [*]: redirect /login with error message
    q_parse --> q_no_code: code missing
    q_no_code --> [*]: redirect /login?error=no_auth_code
    q_parse --> q_exchange: code present
    q_exchange --> q_exchange_fail: supabase.auth.exchangeCodeForSession(code) fails
    q_exchange_fail --> q_check_flow_state: error.message contains 'flow state'
    q_check_flow_state --> [*]: redirect /login?error=session_expired
    q_exchange_fail --> [*]: redirect /login?error=session_failed
    q_exchange --> q_check_session: exchange succeeds
    q_check_session --> q_no_session: no session or user in data
    q_no_session --> [*]: redirect /login?error=session_failed
    q_check_session --> q_extract_discord: session and user exist
    q_extract_discord --> q_no_discord_uid: discordUid = user.user_metadata.provider_id is null
    q_no_discord_uid --> q_signout_no_uid: signOut()
    q_signout_no_uid --> [*]: redirect /login?error=no_discord_uid
    q_extract_discord --> q_member_lookup: discordUid exists
    q_member_lookup --> q_member_not_found: SELECT member.members WHERE discord_uid fails or no record
    q_member_not_found --> q_signout_no_member: signOut()
    q_signout_no_member --> [*]: redirect /login?error=not_registered
    q_member_lookup --> q_authorized: member record found
    q_authorized --> [*]: redirect to auth_next or /dashboard

    note right of q_exchange
        INV-001: PKCE code exchange must succeed to establish session
        INV-002: discord_uid from user_metadata.provider_id must exist
        INV-003: user must exist in member.members table to be authorized
        INV-004: Discord server membership check is commented out (disabled)
    end note
